            "value": "Causabee liest Mail, der du das Label „%@“ gibst — sonst nichts in deinem Postfach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It only reads": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sie liest nur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It never sends, deletes or moves mail, and leaves it unread. The one thing it adds is its label, when you say so.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sie sendet, löscht und verschiebt keine Mail und lässt sie ungelesen. Das Einzige, was sie hinzufügt, ist ihr Label — wenn du es sagst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your password stays yours": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Passwort bleibt deins"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You make a password just for Causabee. It is kept in your iCloud Keychain and goes only to your mail provider.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du legst ein Passwort nur für Causabee an. Es liegt in deinem iCloud-Schlüsselbund und geht nur an deinen Mail-Anbieter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which mail do you use?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welche Mail nutzt du?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick the one you want Causabee to read. You can add another later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wähl die, die Causabee lesen soll. Eine weitere kannst du später hinzufügen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also Google Workspace at work": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auch Google Workspace in der Arbeit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another provider": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein anderer Anbieter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Outlook and Hotmail can’t be read by apps like Causabee yet — Microsoft only lets its own apps in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Outlook und Hotmail können Apps wie Causabee noch nicht lesen — Microsoft lässt nur eigene Apps hinein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Gmail address": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Gmail-Adresse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your iCloud address": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine iCloud-Adresse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your mail address": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Mail-Adresse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The one whose mail Causabee should read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die, deren Mail Causabee lesen soll."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next, %@ makes a password just for Causabee. It takes about a minute.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Als Nächstes legt %@ ein Passwort nur für Causabee an. Das dauert etwa eine Minute."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Outlook can’t be connected yet — continue to see what works instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Outlook lässt sich noch nicht verbinden — weiter, um zu sehen, was stattdessen geht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Outlook can’t be connected yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Outlook lässt sich noch nicht verbinden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Microsoft lets only its own apps read Outlook and Hotmail mail. That isn’t something Causabee can change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Microsoft lässt nur eigene Apps Outlook- und Hotmail-Mail lesen. Daran kann Causabee nichts ändern."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What works instead:": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was stattdessen geht:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forward the mails you want sorted to a Gmail or iCloud address, and connect that.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leite die Mails, die einsortiert werden sollen, an eine Gmail- oder iCloud-Adresse weiter und verbinde die."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Or drop a mail’s PDF or a screenshot into Causabee — it sorts those too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oder zieh das PDF einer Mail oder einen Screenshot in Causabee — die sortiert sie auch ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which provider is it?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welcher Anbieter ist es?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee couldn’t find the settings for %@ by itself. Pick your provider:": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee konnte die Einstellungen für %@ nicht selbst finden. Wähl deinen Anbieter:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not listed? Enter the settings yourself ›": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nicht dabei? Gib die Einstellungen selbst ein ›"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your provider’s settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Einstellungen deines Anbieters"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your provider’s help pages name them — look for “IMAP”. Causabee connects securely, usually on port 993.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Hilfeseiten deines Anbieters nennen sie — such nach „IMAP“. Causabee verbindet sich sicher, meist über Port 993."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Incoming mail server": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Server für eingehende Mail"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Port": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Port"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Many providers want a password made for apps rather than your usual one. Their settings say so.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Viele Anbieter wollen ein Passwort für Apps statt deines üblichen. Die Einstellungen des Anbieters sagen es."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste the 16 letters": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die 16 Buchstaben einfügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That’s it — %@ Connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das war's — %@ Verbinden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee noticed something on your clipboard — %@ Paste to use it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee hat etwas in deiner Zwischenablage gesehen — %@ Einfügen, um es zu nehmen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy the 16 letters at Google, then %@ Paste.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kopier die 16 Buchstaben bei Google, dann %@ Einfügen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make a password for Causabee": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Passwort für Causabee anlegen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Google gives apps like Causabee their own password, so your real one is never shared.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Google gibt Apps wie Causabee ein eigenes Passwort, damit dein echtes nie weitergegeben wird."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ “Open Google” and sign in if asked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ „Google öffnen“ und melde dich an, wenn du gefragt wirst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type “Causabee” as the app name, then %@ Create.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gib „Causabee“ als App-Namen ein, dann %@ Erstellen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Google shows 16 letters. Copy them and come back here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Google zeigt 16 Buchstaben. Kopier sie und komm hierher zurück."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App passwords": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App-Passwörter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App name": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App-Name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste the code": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Den Code einfügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy the code at Apple, then %@ Paste.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kopier den Code bei Apple, dann %@ Einfügen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple gives apps like Causabee their own password, so your Apple Account password is never shared.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple gibt Apps wie Causabee ein eigenes Passwort, damit das Passwort deines Apple-Accounts nie weitergegeben wird."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ “Open Apple Account” and sign in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ „Apple-Account öffnen“ und melde dich an."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Sign-In and Security, then App-Specific Passwords.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wähl Anmelden und Sicherheit, dann App-spezifische Passwörter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name it “Causabee”, %@ Create, and copy the code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nenn es „Causabee“, %@ Erstellen, und kopier den Code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App-Specific Passwords": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App-spezifische Passwörter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A password for Causabee": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Passwort für Causabee"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ wants a password made for apps. Make one named “Causabee”, copy it, and paste it here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ will ein Passwort für Apps. Leg eines namens „Causabee“ an, kopier es und füg es hier ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One setting at %@ first": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zuerst eine Einstellung bei %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ only lets apps read mail once you allow it. It’s a single switch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ lässt Apps erst Mail lesen, wenn du es erlaubst. Es ist ein einziger Schalter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ “Open %@ settings” and sign in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ „%@-Einstellungen öffnen“ und melde dich an."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Under POP3 & IMAP, turn on “Allow access”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schalte unter POP3 & IMAP „Zugriff erlauben“ ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Come back and type your %@ password here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Komm zurück und gib hier dein %@-Passwort ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your %@ mail password": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein %@-Mail-Passwort"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ has a password just for mail, set in its mail settings — not the one you sign in to Telekom with.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ hat ein Passwort nur für Mail, gesetzt in den Mail-Einstellungen — nicht das, mit dem du dich bei Telekom anmeldest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your %@ password": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein %@-Passwort"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee uses it only to read the mail you give it, and keeps it in your iCloud Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee nutzt es nur, um die Mail zu lesen, die du ihr gibst, und bewahrt es in deinem iCloud-Schlüsselbund."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connecting to %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verbinde mit %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This takes a few seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das dauert ein paar Sekunden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One label for Causabee": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Label für Causabee"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One folder for Causabee": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Ordner für Causabee"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee reads only mail with the label “%@”. Shall it make the label in your Gmail now?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee liest nur Mail mit dem Label „%@“. Soll sie das Label jetzt in deinem Gmail anlegen?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee reads only mail in the folder “%@”. Shall it make the folder in your mailbox now?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee liest nur Mail im Ordner „%@“. Soll sie den Ordner jetzt in deinem Postfach anlegen?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Making this label is the only change Causabee ever makes to your mailbox. You can rename or delete it there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Label anzulegen ist die einzige Änderung, die Causabee je an deinem Postfach macht. Du kannst es dort umbenennen oder löschen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Making this folder is the only change Causabee ever makes to your mailbox. You can rename or delete it there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diesen Ordner anzulegen ist die einzige Änderung, die Causabee je an deinem Postfach macht. Du kannst ihn dort umbenennen oder löschen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your label is ready": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Label ist bereit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your folder is ready": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Ordner ist bereit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee found “%@” in your mailbox, with 1 mail in it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee hat „%@“ in deinem Postfach gefunden, mit 1 Mail darin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee found “%@” in your mailbox, with %lld mails in it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee hat „%@“ in deinem Postfach gefunden, mit %lld Mails darin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connected to %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mit %@ verbunden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found “%@” · 1 mail": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„%@“ gefunden · 1 Mail"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found “%@” · %lld mails": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„%@“ gefunden · %lld Mails"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re all set": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alles bereit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Here is how Causabee gets its first mail:": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "So bekommt Causabee ihre erste Mail:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee reads the 1 mail in “%@” now. More come the same way:": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee liest jetzt die eine Mail in „%@“. Weitere kommen genauso:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee reads the %lld mails in “%@” now. More come the same way:": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee liest die %lld Mails in „%@“ jetzt. Weitere kommen genauso:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Gmail, open a mail about something you’re dealing with — a move, a claim, a parent’s care.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffne in Gmail eine Mail zu etwas, das dich beschäftigt — ein Umzug, ein Schadensfall, die Pflege eines Elternteils."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ the label button, and tick “%@”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ den Label-Knopf und hak „%@“ an."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Mail, open a mail about something you’re dealing with — a move, a claim, a parent’s care.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffne in Mail eine Mail zu etwas, das dich beschäftigt — ein Umzug, ein Schadensfall, die Pflege eines Elternteils."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move it to the folder “%@”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verschieb sie in den Ordner „%@“."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Come back here. Causabee reads it and sorts it into a matter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Komm hierher zurück. Causabee liest sie und sortiert sie in ein Anliegen ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connected · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verbunden · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Label “%@” found": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Label „%@“ gefunden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Label “%@” made": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Label „%@“ angelegt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Folder “%@” found": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ordner „%@“ gefunden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Folder “%@” made": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ordner „%@“ angelegt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Password kept in iCloud Keychain — your other devices have it too": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passwort im iCloud-Schlüsselbund — deine anderen Geräte haben es auch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ didn’t take that password": {
