            "state": "translated",
            "value": " und "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee forgets what it read in it": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee vergisst, was sie darin gelesen hat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    ". The file itself stays where it is.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ". Die Datei selbst bleibt, wo sie ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rename file": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Datei umbenennen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only here in Causabee: the file keeps its own name in the mail and in its folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur hier in Causabee: in der Mail und im Ordner behält die Datei ihren eigenen Namen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take the link out of the matter. The document itself stays where it is.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nimmt den Link aus dem Anliegen. Das Dokument selbst bleibt, wo es ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "https://docs.google.com/…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "https://docs.google.com/…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name, e.g. Cost list": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Name, z. B. Kostenliste"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee does not open the link by itself. The assistant learns only the name, never the address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee öffnet den Link nicht von selbst. Der Assistent erfährt nur den Namen, nie die Adresse."
