    "with your own key": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "mit deinem eigenen Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the demo, the mail is made up and nothing is sent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Im Beispiel ist die Mail erfunden, und nichts wird gesendet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pro: %@ reads what comes in, as it comes — names disguised first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro: %@ liest, was hereinkommt, sobald es kommt — Namen vorher unkenntlich."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple's model on this device reads what comes in. Nothing leaves it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apples Modell auf diesem Gerät liest, was hereinkommt. Nichts verlässt es."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New mail comes in by its threads, and you place the rest. Nothing leaves this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neue Mail kommt über ihre Threads herein, den Rest ordnest du ein. Nichts verlässt dieses Gerät."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ reads what comes in with your own key — names disguised first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ liest, was hereinkommt, mit deinem eigenen Key — Namen vorher unkenntlich."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the demo, nothing reads what comes in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Im Beispiel liest nichts, was hereinkommt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sorting in 1 mail on this device, with Apple's model: nothing leaves it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sortiere 1 Mail auf diesem Gerät ein, mit Apples Modell: nichts verlässt es."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sorting in %lld mails on this device, with Apple's model: nothing leaves it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sortiere %lld Mails auf diesem Gerät ein, mit Apples Modell: nichts verlässt es."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bringing in 1 mail by their threads. You place the rest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bringe 1 Mail über ihren Thread herein. Den Rest ordnest du ein."
          }
