    "General": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allgemein"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plan": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fewer, real tasks": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weniger, echte Aufgaben"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rule from the test: no task for saying yes or getting ready, unless the mail asks for it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Regel aus dem Test: keine Aufgabe fürs Zusagen oder Vorbereiten, außer die Mail bittet darum."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " A mail is sorted only once: what a model sorted in stays that way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " Eine Mail wird nur einmal einsortiert: was ein Modell einsortiert hat, bleibt so."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calendar and Reminders": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kalender und Erinnerungen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Matter folders in iCloud Drive": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ordner der Anliegen in iCloud Drive"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bee is glad when you tick a task": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Biene freut sich, wenn du eine Aufgabe abhakst"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Public names": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffentliche Namen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Privacy": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Privatsphäre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Names are disguised before anything leaves this Mac. Big companies and brands — Expedia, Lufthansa — are not: the AI reads them as they are, and a question looked up on the web may name them. Mark one here, or in a person's menu.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Namen werden unkenntlich gemacht, bevor etwas diesen Mac verlässt. Große Firmen und Marken — Expedia, Lufthansa — nicht: die KI liest sie, wie sie sind, und eine im Web nachgeschlagene Frage kann sie nennen. Markiere eine hier, oder im Menü einer Person."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key is kept in the Keychain like the mail password, never in a file. It gets only pseudonymised text.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Key liegt im Schlüsselbund wie das Mail-Passwort, nie in einer Datei. Er bekommt nur pseudonymisierten Text."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pro · ": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro · "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pro, written by %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro, geschrieben von %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use Pro?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro nutzen?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pro reads what comes in — mail, screenshots, photos, files — as it arrives, with %@ — names disguised. You still decide what goes into a matter. Without Pro, nothing is read by the AI until you tap.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pro liest, was hereinkommt — Mail, Screenshots, Fotos, Dateien —, sobald es ankommt, mit %@ — Namen unkenntlich. Was in ein Anliegen kommt, entscheidest weiter du. Ohne Pro liest die KI nichts, bis du tippst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
