        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neues Detail"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A membership number, a file number, a ward and room: what you need on the phone with them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Mitgliedsnummer, ein Aktenzeichen, Station und Zimmer: was du am Telefon mit ihnen brauchst."
