            "value": " — erst nach "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "yours, together with others": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "deine, gemeinsam mit anderen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "someone else's — you wait for it": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "von jemand anderem — du wartest darauf"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "whose is not clear": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "unklar, wessen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tick off": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abhaken"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looking it up …": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wird nachgeschlagen …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You put away a question to look up": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast eine Frage zum Nachschlagen weggelegt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Public Name": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffentlicher Name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a big company or a brand: its name goes to the AI as it is, and may be named in a question looked up on the web.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Für eine große Firma oder Marke: ihr Name geht so, wie er ist, an die KI, und kann in einer im Web nachgeschlagenen Frage vorkommen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a company or brand": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Firma oder Marke hinzufügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Public name — not disguised": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffentlicher Name — nicht unkenntlich"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take it back: the next writing goes without it": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zurücknehmen: das nächste Schreiben geht ohne es"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Comment": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kommentar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Causabee missed, or how it should be": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was Causabee übersehen hat, oder wie es sein soll"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee writes it again with your words, and keeps them — they are never written over.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee schreibt es mit deinen Worten neu, und behält sie — sie werden nie überschrieben."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About you": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Über dich"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ready": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bereit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up Causabee": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee einrichten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test mode: nothing is saved": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Testbetrieb: nichts wird gesichert"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "optional": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "freiwillig"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing here costs money. Mail is only read until you click “Sort in”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nichts hier kostet Geld. Mail wird nur gelesen, bis du auf „Einsortieren“ klickst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close for now. Causabee → Set Up Causabee … opens it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erst mal schließen. Causabee → Causabee einrichten … öffnet es wieder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " — not connected, you can do it later": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " — nicht verbunden, du kannst es später machen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " — still missing": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " — fehlt noch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How it goes from here": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wie es von hier weitergeht"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Put the label “Causabee” on the mails you want sorted. Start with a few from one matter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gib den Mails, die einsortiert werden sollen, das Label „Causabee“. Fang mit ein paar aus einem Anliegen an."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click “Get new mail”. Causabee fetches them; nothing is read by an AI yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klick auf „Neue Mail holen“. Causabee holt sie; noch liest keine KI mit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click “Sort in”. Each mail is sorted once — by Apple's model on this Mac, or with Pro by the bigger AI — into a matter with its tasks, dates and people.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klick auf „Einsortieren“. Jede Mail wird einmal einsortiert — von Apples Modell auf diesem Mac, oder mit Pro von der größeren KI — in ein Anliegen mit seinen Aufgaben, Terminen und Personen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drop a screenshot, a photo, a PDF or a note onto the window any time. It is sorted the same way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zieh jederzeit einen Screenshot, ein Foto, ein PDF oder eine Notiz auf das Fenster. Es wird genauso einsortiert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your name and the email addresses you use, one per line. Causabee needs them to tell you apart from everyone else: you are never listed as a person in your own matters, and tasks for you are marked “Mine”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Name und die Mail-Adressen, die du nutzt, eine pro Zeile. Causabee braucht sie, um dich von allen anderen zu unterscheiden: du stehst nie als Person in deinen eigenen Anliegen, und Aufgaben für dich sind als „Meine“ markiert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a nickname if people write to you by it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gib einen Rufnamen an, wenn man dich so anschreibt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee is free for three open matters: Apple's model on this Mac reads your mail, and nothing leaves it. Causabee Plus holds every matter; Causabee Pro has the bigger AI read and answer, names disguised first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee ist für drei offene Anliegen gratis: Apples Modell auf diesem Mac liest deine Mail, und nichts verlässt ihn. Causabee Plus hält jedes Anliegen; mit Causabee Pro liest und antwortet die größere KI, Namen vorher unkenntlich."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plans are bought in the App Store on your iPhone or iPad. This Mac follows through iCloud — nothing to do here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pakete werden im App Store auf deinem iPhone oder iPad gekauft. Dieser Mac folgt über iCloud — hier ist nichts zu tun."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee reads your mail the way a mail app does. It only reads: it never sends, deletes, moves or marks mail as read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee liest deine Mail, wie eine Mail-App es tut. Sie liest nur: sie sendet, löscht, verschiebt und markiert keine Mail als gelesen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connected: %@, signed in with Google": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verbunden: %@, mit Google angemeldet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connected: %@ on %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verbunden: %@ auf %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee reads only the mail that has the label “%@”. Nothing else in your mailbox is read. You decide what it sees by putting the label on a mail.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee liest nur die Mail mit dem Label „%@“. Sonst wird nichts in deinem Postfach gelesen. Du entscheidest, was sie sieht, indem du einer Mail das Label gibst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee reads only the mail in the folder “%@”. Nothing else in your mailbox is read. You decide what it sees by moving a mail there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee liest nur die Mail im Ordner „%@“. Sonst wird nichts in deinem Postfach gelesen. Du entscheidest, was sie sieht, indem du eine Mail dorthin verschiebst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Gmail, on the left, click “+” next to Labels and make a label called “%@”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klick in Gmail links auf „+“ neben Labels und leg ein Label namens „%@“ an."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open a mail, click the label icon, and tick “%@”. Start with a few mails from one matter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffne eine Mail, klick auf das Label-Symbol und hak „%@“ an. Fang mit ein paar Mails aus einem Anliegen an."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Replies in the same thread are found by themselves: label a thread once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Antworten im selben Thread werden von selbst gefunden: gib einem Thread das Label einmal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tip: a Gmail filter can put the label on mail from the school, the landlord or the insurer by itself. The label stays on the mail; you can take it off at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tipp: ein Gmail-Filter kann das Label von selbst auf Mail von der Schule, der Hausverwaltung oder der Versicherung setzen. Das Label bleibt an der Mail; du kannst es jederzeit entfernen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In your mail app or on the provider's website, make a folder called “%@”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leg in deiner Mail-App oder auf der Website des Anbieters einen Ordner namens „%@“ an."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move or copy the mails you want sorted into it. Start with a few from one matter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verschieb oder kopier die Mails, die einsortiert werden sollen, hinein. Fang mit ein paar aus einem Anliegen an."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The name must be “%@”. Capitals do not matter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Name muss „%@“ sein. Groß und klein ist einerlei."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found “%@”, with 1 mail.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„%@“ gefunden, mit 1 Mail."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found “%@”, with %lld mails.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "„%@“ gefunden, mit %lld Mails."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no “%@” yet. Make it, put it on a few mails, then check again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es gibt noch kein „%@“. Leg es an, gib es ein paar Mails und sieh dann noch einmal nach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use another account": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anderen Account nutzen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not look: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nachsehen ging nicht: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appointments and deadlines can go into Calendar, and tasks into Reminders, with one click. Causabee also sees what is already there, so nothing is added twice. It only adds what you click.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Termine und Fristen können mit einem Klick in den Kalender, Aufgaben in Erinnerungen. Causabee sieht auch, was schon dort ist, damit nichts zweimal hinzukommt. Sie fügt nur hinzu, was du anklickst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connected to Calendar and to Reminders.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mit dem Kalender und mit Erinnerungen verbunden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connected to Calendar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mit dem Kalender verbunden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connected to Reminders.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mit Erinnerungen verbunden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verbunden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No access. Allow it in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Calendars and Reminders.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kein Zugriff. Erlaub es in den Systemeinstellungen → Datenschutz & Sicherheit → Kalender und Erinnerungen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can skip this and connect later in Settings (⌘,).": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du kannst das überspringen und später in den Einstellungen (⌘,) verbinden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your words": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Worte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wann?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When, for its %lld tasks?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wann, für seine %lld Aufgaben?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move to …": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verschieben nach …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the image": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bild öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the file": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Datei öffnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taken from the mail it is attached to. It stays there; here it is only a cached copy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aus der Mail genommen, an der sie hängt. Sie bleibt dort; hier ist nur eine Kopie im Zwischenspeicher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copied into Causabee: it had no place of its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Causabee kopiert: sie hatte keinen eigenen Platz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stays where it is: %@. Causabee only remembers the path.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bleibt, wo sie ist: %@. Causabee merkt sich nur den Pfad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reading on the Mac …": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wird auf dem Mac gelesen …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scanning on the Mac …": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wird auf dem Mac erfasst …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sorting it in …": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wird einsortiert …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dismissed — nothing was taken into a matter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weggelegt — nichts wurde in ein Anliegen übernommen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bring back": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zurückholen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan it again. If it was sorted in before, that answer is used again and costs nothing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Noch einmal lesen. Wurde es schon einmal einsortiert, wird diese Antwort wiederverwendet und kostet nichts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Document": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dokument"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Photo or scan": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Foto oder Scan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Picture": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bild"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "what would be sent, pseudonymised": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "was gesendet würde, pseudonymisiert"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Left out: ": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ausgelassen: "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which matter?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welches Anliegen?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name of the new matter": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Name des neuen Anliegens"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mine": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "meine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ours": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "unsere"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "waiting for": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "wartet auf"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "unclear": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "unklar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "by %@ %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "bis %@ %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it says": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was darin steht"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "People: ": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Personen: "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take in": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Übernehmen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "day": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tag"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "days": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "week": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Woche"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "weeks": {
      "localizations": {
