    "Call %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ anrufen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee reads your calendars and reminders to show what is there already. It adds only when %@ “Add”. What is connected is kept in step both ways: ticked off, moved, renamed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee liest deine Kalender und Erinnerungen, um zu zeigen, was schon da ist. Sie fügt nur hinzu, wenn %@ „Hinzufügen“. Was verbunden ist, bleibt in beide Richtungen im Takt: abgehakt, verschoben, umbenannt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Causabee reads your calendars and reminders to show what is there already. It adds only when you %@ “Add”. What is connected is kept in step both ways: ticked off, moved, renamed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Causabee liest deine Kalender und Erinnerungen, um zu zeigen, was schon da ist. Sie fügt nur hinzu, wenn du %@ „Hinzufügen“. Was verbunden ist, bleibt in beide Richtungen im Takt: abgehakt, verschoben, umbenannt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
